      {"kind": "text", "flow": "body", "rect": [152, 258, 218, 250], "style": "Letter", "sample": ["Dear families, what a start to the year it has been. The children have come back taller and full of stories, and our new Reception class has settled in beautifully.", "This term our whole-school theme is Rivers and Journeys. Every class will spend a day at the brook, and Year 6 will follow the river all the way to the estuary in November.", "We also welcome Mr Patel, who joins us to teach Year 3, and Mrs Ferris, our new school cook. If you have not tried the Thursday roast, you are missing out.", "As always, my door is open. Please come and find me at the gate if there is anything you would like to talk about."]},
